cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below (and the article, once published)."
type: software
title: "SPARK: Physiology-informed inference of latent cardiac autonomic dynamics from RR intervals"
abstract: >-
  R implementation of SPARK (Stochastic Phase-domain Autonomic Reconstruction Kinetics), a physiology-informed
  stochastic state-space framework for inferring latent vagal-like and sympathetic-like dynamics from RR intervals,
  with the code that reproduces every result, figure and supplementary check of the manuscript.
